WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:08.000
Leviathan Wakes is the first book in The Expanse,
a sci fi-adventure-mystery-drama in space.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.219
In our last video, we explained the cultures
and politics of the series . But what happens

00:00:13.219 --> 00:00:14.679
in Leviathan Wakes?

00:00:14.679 --> 00:00:16.600
And what does it mean?

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:21.720
Eight years ago, a corporation called Protogen
explored Phoebe – a small moon of Saturn

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:27.980
. They found that Phoebe is no moon – it’s
actually a “weapon” created by aliens.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.809
Billions of years ago, Phoebe was “launched”
across interstellar space, carrying a kind

00:00:32.809 --> 00:00:39.100
of “virus” called the “protomolecule”
. The protomolecule infects and changes lifeforms

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:44.559
for some unknown alien purpose . Protogen
executive Dresden tries to control the protomolecule

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:52.000
, to use it, so humans can rewrite their own
biology – and to make Protogen rich . Dresden

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.110
studied the protomolecule by infecting people
on Phoebe, who all died . The molecule seemed

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:03.979
to need more “biomass” . So Dresden and
Protogen plan an “experiment” – to infect

00:01:03.979 --> 00:01:10.040
Eros, feeding a million people to the protomolecule
. They put some molecule on a stealth ship

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.910
called the Anubis , and send it at Eros.

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.610
But along the way, the Anubis meets Julie
Mao.

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:21.150
Julie is the daughter of Jules-Pierre Mao,
a powerful businessman.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:25.860
His company, Mao-Kwikowski, secretly works
with Protogen planning the Eros experiment

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:31.130
. Julie wants “freedom” and independence
from her rich family , so she leaves home

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:35.890
and joins the OPA – a political group fighting
for Belter rights.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:41.270
Julie works with OPA leader Anderson Dawes
on Ceres , and she pilots a “courier ship

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:46.820
called the Scopuli” . Julie finds out that
her father is transporting some “weapon”,

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:52.760
so she and the OPA intercept the Anubis . But
the Scopuli is overwhelmed – the crew’s

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:56.680
taken prisoner on the Anubis, and Julie’s
locked in storage.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:00.860
Then, the Anubis uses the empty Scopuli as
a trap.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.540
They plant a Martian transmitter on the Scopuli
and send a distress beacon.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:11.280
The Sirenum scopuli are the islands of the
sirens of Greek mythology, who lure sailors

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:16.089
to their deaths . Cause the Scopuli lures
a nearby Belter ship called the Canterbury

00:02:16.089 --> 00:02:21.069
– then the Anubis destroys the Cant . But
the Martian transmitter they planted makes

00:02:21.069 --> 00:02:26.049
it look like Mars killed the Cant . Protogen
does this to create conflict between Mars

00:02:26.049 --> 00:02:31.799
and the Belt – to “distract” everyone
from the Eros experiment . But Protogen underestimates

00:02:31.799 --> 00:02:36.040
the Cant – and its Executive Officer, James
Holden.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:40.530
Holden is from Earth, and he served in the
UN navy – the uh, Space Force.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:46.599
But he got disillusioned with the “authoritarian”
UNN , so he left and got work on the Canterbury

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:51.709
. Holden’s “An idealist” – he believes
in truth , and justice, and doing the “right

00:02:51.709 --> 00:02:57.799
thing” . He’s a “natural leader” , self-sacrificing
– a classic hero type . When the Cant is

00:02:57.799 --> 00:03:02.760
destroyed, Holden leads the survivors – Naomi,
Amos, Alex and Shed.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:07.859
Holden helps bring them together as a team
. But he also makes rash decisions – he

00:03:07.859 --> 00:03:12.420
tries to chase down the Anubis , to bring
them to justice, which’d probably just get

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:17.349
them killed – Naomi has to stop him from
being an “idiot” . But then Holden does

00:03:17.349 --> 00:03:22.329
something dumber – he makes a broadcast
telling the universe that someone with a Martian

00:03:22.329 --> 00:03:28.239
transmitter killed the Cant . It is the truth
, and Holden believes “People need to know”

00:03:28.239 --> 00:03:32.680
. But spreading this news creates conflict
between Mars and the Belt – which is exactly

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:38.719
what Protogen wants . Holden’s sense of
honesty and justice helps cause a war.

00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:42.730
Holden’s also forced to question his sense
of romance.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:46.920
Naomi points out that Holden has a habit of
treating every little crush like it’s true

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:52.279
love . It’s only after Holden changes his
behaviour that he and Naomi get together f

00:03:52.279 --> 00:03:56.769
– helping Holden become a more mature lover,
as well as a better leader.

00:03:56.769 --> 00:04:02.469
So from the beginning, Holden’s naïve idealism
around love and truth and justice are challenged

00:04:02.469 --> 00:04:06.689
– especially by the other main character,
Miller.

00:04:06.689 --> 00:04:10.450
Miller is a detective for private security
on Ceres.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:15.900
And unlike Holden, he believes that “moral
flexibility” is “necessary” – he’ll

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:21.069
destroy evidence, make shady deals, if that’s
what it takes to gets shit done . Miller has

00:04:21.069 --> 00:04:26.449
a complex identity – cause he’s a Belter,
born on Ceres, but he works for an Earth-owned

00:04:26.449 --> 00:04:29.020
company , policing Belters.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:33.990
So some Belters see him as a “Traitor to
[his] people” . At the start of the book,

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:39.140
Miller finds that the crime gangs of Ceres
are strangely inactive lately . And Ceres

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:44.370
security’s riot gear is stolen . We later
learn the reason for this is that Protogen

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:49.960
hires Ceres thugs to help run their experiment
on Eros – and the thugs take Ceres’ riot

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:55.169
gear with them . This is a problem for Miller
when Belters riot over the destruction of

00:04:55.169 --> 00:05:01.270
the Cant – thanks to Holden’s broadcast
. Miller gets assigned a new job – Jules-Pierre

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:06.979
Mao wants Julie found and taken home . At
first, Miller dismisses Julie as a “Poor

00:05:06.979 --> 00:05:11.990
little rich girl” . But while investigating
her activity on Ceres , he learns to respect

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:12.990
her.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:16.810
She’s capable, “smart” , and she’s
“tough” – learning jiu-jitsu after being

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.410
attacked one time.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:23.330
By joining the OPA, Julie sacrificed a life
of “wealth and privilege” for a cause

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:29.370
that she believes in . Miller is a “nihilistic”
, empty man – worn down by the corruption

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:35.169
and horror of his police work . But Julie
inspires him to believe in something – Miller

00:05:35.169 --> 00:05:37.330
believes in Julie.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:42.440
When Miller gets fired for being unreliable,
renegade and drunk , he loses “the career

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:48.000
that [had] defined [him]” . All he has left
as a purpose in life is finding Julie .

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:53.979
Meanwhile, Holden and crew are captured by
a Martian flagship called the Donnager, but

00:05:53.979 --> 00:05:56.870
the Donnager’s attacked by Protogen stealth
ships.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:02.050
Holden’s crew escapes on a Martian ship,
except Shed is randomly killed by a stray

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.599
gauss round.

00:06:03.599 --> 00:06:08.379
Some of the characters and plot of The Expanse
began in a pen-and-paper role-playing game

00:06:08.379 --> 00:06:10.290
run by Ty Franck.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:15.189
When the person playing Shed left this game,
Shed’s character had to be suddenly removed.

00:06:15.189 --> 00:06:20.810
And that’s why Shed’s death comes so suddenly
in the story . Anyway Protogen destroys the

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:25.240
Donnager , but Mars thinks the Belt did it
– which leads to “war” between Mars

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:30.650
and the Belt . So Protogen’s plan works
– their false flag attacks cause a war that

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.970
distracts everyone from Eros.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:38.750
Holden and crew settle in to their new Martian
ship – Holden names it “Rocinante”.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:43.310
This is a reference to Don Quixote, the story
of a wannabe knight who attacks windmills

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.930
thinking they’re giants.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:51.000
So the name Rocinante evokes adventure and
heroism, but also idealistic silliness – which

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:57.300
pretty much sums up Holden The Roci crew take
refuge with Fred Johnson – an OPA leader

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:01.830
whose company is building a giant Mormon spaceship
called the Nauvoo.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:06.889
Through the OPA, Fred worked with the Scopuli,
and he gets a message connected to the Scopuli

00:07:06.889 --> 00:07:11.500
from Eros – so Holden and crew go investigate
.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:16.009
Miller follows the Roci crew to Eros , and
helps them survive an attack by Protogen’s

00:07:16.009 --> 00:07:17.009
men.

00:07:17.009 --> 00:07:21.169
Then together they find Julie Mao – dead
from the protomolecule.

00:07:21.169 --> 00:07:26.150
Cause what happened was – after the Protogen
ship Anubis captured the Scopuli and destroyed

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:32.090
the Cant, their protomolecule sample leaked
– killing everyone on board , except for

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.840
Julie, in storage.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:37.389
Julie broke out, and hid the Anubis , then
went to Eros.

00:07:37.389 --> 00:07:43.669
But she’d been infected – so she slowly,
horrifically, died “alone” . Losing the

00:07:43.669 --> 00:07:49.419
Anubis was a problem for Protogen cause they
needed that protomolecule sample for Eros.

00:07:49.419 --> 00:07:55.669
So Protogen follows Holden to Julie – and
uses her infected body as the seed to start

00:07:55.669 --> 00:08:01.000
the Eros experiment . For “crowd control”,
Protogen uses those thugs from Ceres with

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:05.659
the stolen riot gear – who now call themselves
“Carne Por la Machina” – “Meat for

00:08:05.659 --> 00:08:10.979
the machine” . They fake an emergency, and
lead the people of Eros into “radiation

00:08:10.979 --> 00:08:15.979
shelters” – which are actually used to
infect everyone with the protomolecule . Infected

00:08:15.979 --> 00:08:21.419
people become zombies, Ceres thugs fight,
Holden and Miller get irradiated – it’s

00:08:21.419 --> 00:08:22.760
a bad time.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:27.669
And amidst the all suffering and violence,
Miller starts to welcome death – he’s

00:08:27.669 --> 00:08:33.490
tired and broken and wants “release” from
his trauma and pain . His only sense of hope

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:39.890
is his imagination of Julie, the “ghost”
of this dead girl he’s never met . [] Miller

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:46.390
and Holden work together and escape Eros alive,
but they also clash over their differences.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:50.590
Holden stops Miller from shooting an infected
person – says Miller doesn’t “get to

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:56.350
decide” who lives and dies . Miller criticises
Holden for publicly broadcasting sensitive

00:08:56.350 --> 00:09:01.921
information . Like, Holden broadcasts evidence
connecting Protogen’s ships to Earth – so

00:09:01.921 --> 00:09:07.880
then Earth attacks Mars and destroys the moon
of Deimos , making the worst war in history

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:13.620
worse . Holden thinks telling everyone the
truth is the right thing to do, and the best

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:17.810
way to make peace . But Miller argues that
the truth can be dangerous – you’ve gotta

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:23.620
be more strategic to get good outcomes . There
is no “right thing” to do – just a whole

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:29.140
lot of “maybe a little less wrong” . So
Miller challenges Holden’s “simplistic”

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:34.800
view of the world , and helps him to see the
complexity and the shades of grey.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:39.500
Miller and the Roci crew find the Anubis where
Julie had hidden it . And they destroy it

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:45.570
– as symbolic justice for the Cant . They
also learn about Protogen’s experiment on

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:46.570
Eros.

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:51.560
So they team up with Fred and the OPA to attack
Protogen’s research base, Thoth Station

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:58.630
– Thoth was an Egyptian god associated with
science and with judgement of the dead . Holden

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:04.910
Miller and Fred take the station, and confront
Dresden – “the architect of the Eros project”

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:10.139
. Instead of fighting or begging mercy, Dresden
makes rational arguments why the Eros project

00:10:10.139 --> 00:10:11.550
should continue.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:16.560
He says studying the protomolecule is worth
killing a million people , cause the power

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:21.149
to rewrite biology would let humans expand
to distant stars.

00:10:21.149 --> 00:10:25.520
He says the protomolecule proves there are
hostile aliens out there – and humans will

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:31.899
need the power of the protomolecule if they
face its creators . And besides, Eros is already

00:10:31.899 --> 00:10:37.029
infected – so stopping the project won’t
save anyone, it’ll only “Waste the data”

00:10:37.029 --> 00:10:43.070
and make those people “[die] for nothing”
. Holden is disgusted by Dresden’s cold

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:48.529
logic – but he sees that Dresden may have
a point . When Miller sees that people

00:10:48.529 --> 00:10:53.930
are listening to evil space Mengele, he kills
Dresden on the spot.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:59.949
And Holden is outraged that Miller would kill
someone in cold blood – says it’s inhuman,

00:10:59.949 --> 00:11:02.380
and unjust. “What about a trial?”

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:05.760
What makes Miller the “judge, jury, and
executioner”?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.670
Miller argues that with Dresden’s power
and connections, he was “going to get away”

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:15.359
with his crimes, and continue his experiments
– so killing Dresden “had to be done”

00:11:15.359 --> 00:11:21.330
. But Holden can’t trust someone who “unilaterally”
headshots people he disagrees with . So Holden

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:24.089
kicks Miller out of the Roci crew.

00:11:24.089 --> 00:11:25.699
And Miller is devastated.

00:11:25.699 --> 00:11:29.889
He’d started to think of the Roci as his
“home” , his family.

00:11:29.889 --> 00:11:36.470
But now he’s alone – with no home, no
job, no friends . He feels that the hard choices

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:41.980
he’s made to survive have cut him off from
human connection , left him empty and numb

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:48.079
– he compares himself to Protogen . Miller’s
only hope for connection and redemption is

00:11:48.079 --> 00:11:52.990
his imagination of Julie – “You belong
with me”, she says .

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:58.620
Eros, infected with the protomolecule, does
some freaky stuff.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:04.970
The bodies of the people of Eros are reshaped
into Cronenbergian fleshscapes , “like Hieronymous

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:11.920
Bosch made real” . Eros broadcasts ghostly
voices made from the audio files and the minds

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:17.120
of the million people it consumed . Holden,
Miller and Fred are worried that that this

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:19.019
horrorshow might spread.

00:12:19.019 --> 00:12:24.450
So they plan to take the giant Mormon spaceship
the Nauvoo, and slam it into Eros, to knock

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:29.410
the whole asteroid into the sun – ending
the threat.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:35.610
Miller sets up bombs on Eros, then chooses
to stay there . He feels too “tired” and

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:41.930
“broken” to ever “reconnect to humanity”
– Miller just wants to die with Julie.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:48.029
He watches as the Nauvoo, the “hammer of
God” fills the sky, screams towards him,

00:12:48.029 --> 00:12:49.770
then misses.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:54.709
The voice of Eros shouts “DON’T YOU FUCKING
TOUCH ME!”, and the whole asteroid moves

00:12:54.709 --> 00:13:02.230
– uses some alien force to dodge the Nauvoo
. Then Eros starts moving towards Earth, apparently

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:09.080
to infect the population . But Miller realises
that the ghostly voice of Eros includes Julie.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:15.700
The Eros protomolecule’s mind grew from
Julie – “it infected her”, and “she

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:21.170
infected it” . Deep in Eros, Miller finds
the infected Julie – she’s controlling

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:25.220
Eros, dreaming that she’s flying her ship
the Razorback.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:29.600
When she says ‘don’t you fucking touch
me’, she’s remembering that time she was

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:30.600
attacked.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.690
Her memories and personality are intertwined
with the alien mind.

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:40.300
So Miller convinces Julie to fly Eros to Venus
instead of Earth.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:46.649
He removes his helmet and lets the protomolecule
take him as he and Julie and Eros descend

00:13:46.649 --> 00:13:49.130
into the clouds of Venus.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:55.130
The cynical, nihilistic Miller finds something
to believe in . And Holden is left a more

00:13:55.130 --> 00:14:01.980
mature and experienced hero – able to question
his idealistic view of the world and himself.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:08.890
This helps him face the dangers of later books
– including what emerges from Venus.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:15.180
So Leviathan Wakes explores different perspectives
on how to live in a complex universe.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:21.600
Rationality and cold realism gets shit done,
but love and belief give life meaning.

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:26.529
The Expanse is about futuristic technology
and fantastic worlds – but it’s grounded

00:14:26.529 --> 00:14:31.880
in the same human passions, flaws and ideals
that cause conflict today.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:37.819
Whether on Earth, or amongst the stars, “the
problems we have are the ones we bring with

00:14:37.819 --> 00:14:41.250
us” .
In The Expanse TV show, Miller finds a data

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:44.779
broker who hides a data chip inside his own
leg.

